{"tool_name":"alphaimpute","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"alphaimpute","home":"https://sites.google.com/site/hickeyjohn/alphaimpute","license":"Not licensed","summary":"Impute and phase genotype data in populations with pedigree information available. The program uses segregation analysis and haplotype library imputation to impute alleles and genotypes.","addition_date":"2017-08-20T15:01:01Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-25T14:01:38.492622Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool"],"collections":["Animal and Crop Genomics"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:alphaimpute","cost":"Free of charge (with restrictions)","credit":[{"email":"john.hickey@roslin.ed.ac.uk","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"],"url":"http://www.alphagenes.roslin.ed.ac.uk/forums/forum/alphaimpute/"}],"documentation":[{"note":"Manual link available on homepage.","type":["User manual"],"url":"https://sites.google.com/site/hickeyjohn/alphaimpute"}],"edit_permission":{"authors":["animalandcropgenomics"],"type":"group"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Imputation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3557"}]}],"name":"AlphaImpute","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"admin","publication":[{"doi":"10.1186/1297-9686-44-9","metadata":{"abstract":"Background: Efficient, robust, and accurate genotype imputation algorithms make large-scale application of genomic selection cost effective. An algorithm that imputes alleles or allele probabilities for all animals in the pedigree and for all genotyped single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNP) provides a framework to combine all pedigree, genomic, and phenotypic information into a single-stage genomic evaluation. Methods: An algorithm was developed for imputation of genotypes in pedigreed populations that allows imputation for completely ungenotyped animals and for low-density genotyped animals, accommodates a wide variety of pedigree structures for genotyped animals, imputes unmapped SNP, and works for large datasets. The method involves simple phasing rules, long-range phasing and haplotype library imputation and segregation analysis. Results: Imputation accuracy was high and computational cost was feasible for datasets with pedigrees of up to 25 000 animals. The resulting single-stage genomic evaluation increased the accuracy of estimated genomic breeding values compared to a scenario in which phenotypes on relatives that were not genotyped were ignored. Conclusions: The developed imputation algorithm and software and the resulting single-stage genomic evaluation method provide powerful new ways to exploit imputation and to obtain more accurate genetic evaluations. \u00a9 2012 Hickey et al.; licensee BioMed Central Ltd.","authors":[{"name":"Cleveland M.A."},{"name":"Hickey J.M."},{"name":"Kinghorn B.P."},{"name":"Tier B."},{"name":"Van Der Werf J.H."}],"citationCount":117,"date":"2012-06-25T00:00:00Z","journal":"Genetics Selection Evolution","title":"A phasing and imputation method for pedigreed populations that results in a single-stage genomic evaluation"},"pmcid":"PMC3378429","pmid":"22462519","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Population genetics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3056"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"AlphaImpute","home":"https://bio.tools/alphaimpute","license":"Not licensed","summary":"Impute and phase genotype data in populations with pedigree information available. The program uses segregation analysis and haplotype library imputation to impute alleles and genotypes.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:alphaimpute/cmd/sites.google.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"sourcecode":{"interpreted":true}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"documentation":{"manual":true},"license":{"ope